E ContactPhase              | GestureSequence.h | 25-32  | contract                           | -  | Where one contact stands in its own lifetime. system delivers both in the same tick. A consumer that seizes on `Arrived` and resolves on `Released` therefore never loses either edge to a stalled or coalesced tick.
