    has   Arrived     ContactPhase  [-]  ?
    has   Travelling  ContactPhase  [-]  ?
    has   Released    ContactPhase  [-]  ?
    has   PhaseCount  ContactPhase  [-]  ?
    by    Source/DrawerSpace.cpp, Source/GestureSequence.cpp
    note  🔴 Exactly one tick reports `Arrived` and exactly one reports `Released`, even when the window

